1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,718
Couplet three gives the reason, beginning with for, the only logical connective in the poem.

2
00:00:06,718 --> 00:00:14,375
We are richly linked in hope: richly, just after poverty, relocates wealth into connection.

3
00:00:14,375 --> 00:00:17,226
Woven in history, like a mountain rope.

4
00:00:17,226 --> 00:00:20,533
Think about a climbing rope, as a Nepali reader can.

5
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:23,554
It is many strands twisted into one.

6
00:00:23,554 --> 00:00:26,640
It is useless unless tied at both ends.

7
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:28,932
The climbers share one fate.

8
00:00:28,932 --> 00:00:32,070
And it exists for one purpose: going up.

